        <mxCell id="s1" value="DETAIL 2 of 4 - Waiter and Chef. Manager choice on turn 4: which customer's food comes first&lt;br/&gt;The controller reaches Waiter and Chef only through Restaurant.takeOrder, serveOrder and prepareOrder (Restaurant delegates to the staff object)&lt;br/&gt;The two concrete timelines are tabled in stage 3/test-fixtures/README.md. Both end with bill 648 cents (6.48 dollars)" style="shape=note;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=12;fillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
